\begin{tabular}{|c|c|} \hline Variable & Cut \\ \hline TPC Hits (Primary Tracks) & \(\in(20,50)\) \\ \hline TPC Hits (Global Tracks) & \(\geq 15\) \\ \hline \(N_{\rm hits}/N_{\rm possible}\) & \(\in(.52,1.05)\) \\ \hline Primary DCA & \(<2.0\)cm \\ \hline \end{tabular}
